    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty big shift from what you were saying a minute ago. you went from saying the nationalist groups are the ones to avoid because they cause tension, to saying they're just protecting local interests and that the moderate ones are actually the destabilizing force. \n\nwhy the change in view? are you saying the moderate parties are actually the \"extremists\" in this context?",
